%%{init: {"theme":"dark","themeVariables":{"fontSize":"15px"}}}%%
flowchart TD
  ENV["Environments — Gymnasium<br/>MiniGrid DoorKey · RuleRegime · NoisyTV · SeqGoal<br/>classic-control · <b>MuJoCo continuous</b><br/><i>obs out, actions in</i>"]:::perc
  CUR["Curiosity engine — custom ICM<br/>novelty OR <b>learning-progress</b><br/><i>→ intrinsic reward</i>"]:::cur
  MIX["Reward mixer<br/><b>adaptive gating</b>: intrinsic weight down<br/>as extrinsic reward becomes findable"]:::cur
  POL["PPO policy — StandaloneActorCritic<br/><b>knowledge-conditioned</b> actor-critic"]:::act
  RSSM["World model — RSSM (DreamerV3-style)<br/>posterior = abduction · prior = imagine<br/><b>twohot reward head</b> · <b>goal-prioritized replay</b><br/>continue head · PER · causal-align<br/><i>⚠ weakly action-conditioned — the standing limiter</i>"]:::wm
  DREAM["Dream actor-critic (latent space)<br/>trains in imagination, <b>distilled</b> into real policy<br/>value-gated · annealed · sharpened<br/><b>now knowledge-conditioned</b> (capstone fix)"]:::wm
  STAGE["Developmental stage controller<br/>EXPLORE to EXPLOIT to IMAGINE<br/><i>from WM-error plateau + skill rate</i>"]:::goal
  SELF["Self-model — CompetencePredictor<br/>calibrated P(success) + learning-progress<br/><i>what to practice · notices forgetting<br/>causally load-bearing (Rung 5)</i>"]:::goal
  KG["Knowledge graph + PyKEEN embeddings<br/>facts · rules"]:::wm
  BCAST["Affordance / regime broadcast<br/><b>conditions the policy</b> (Global Workspace)<br/>load-bearing under hidden structure (Rung 6)"]:::wm
  GATE{"task-appropriateness gate<br/><b>auto-disable on continuous</b><br/>action spaces (Hopper ablation)"}:::gate
  SKILL["Skill bank (local)<br/>mint on mastery · warm-start transfer · dedup<br/><i>warm-start route decisive (Rung 1 revisit)</i>"]:::skill
  COMP["CompositeSkillExecutor — <b>NEW</b><br/>chains banked skills via state-aware<br/>subgoal switch · zero-training composition (Rung 2)"]:::skill
  XDOM["Cross-domain transfer — <b>NEW</b> (Rung 7)<br/>domain encoder → shared <b>abstract core</b> → action adapter<br/>supervised representation alignment ✅<br/><i>autonomous correspondence discovery — open</i>"]:::skill
  LLM["Local LLM — Ollama llama3.1:8b<br/>async goal generation + potential-based shaping<br/>stage-gated · offline · cadence ×4<br/><b>stabilizes the whole organism</b> (0/3 vs 1/3 collapse)"]:::goal
  PT["PyTorch (CPU) — tensor foundation"]:::found

  ENV -->|observations| CUR
  ENV -->|observations| POL
  CUR --> MIX --> POL
  POL -->|actions| ENV
  ENV -->|transitions| RSSM
  RSSM -->|prediction error| CUR
  RSSM -->|imagined rollouts| DREAM
  DREAM -->|policy distillation| POL
  RSSM --> STAGE --> MIX
  STAGE --> DREAM
  POL --> SELF --> STAGE
  SELF --> SKILL
  RSSM -->|symbolic facts| KG --> BCAST --> GATE
  GATE -->|"discrete envs: broadcast feature"| POL
  GATE -.->|"continuous envs: OFF"| ENV
  BCAST -->|knowledge feature| DREAM
  SKILL -->|warm-start| POL
  SKILL -->|banked primitives| COMP -->|composed actions| ENV
  SKILL --> XDOM -->|aligned encoder + frozen core| POL
  LLM -->|goals + shaping| MIX
  PT -.-> RSSM
  PT -.-> POL
  PT -.-> DREAM

